{"id":"666290","name":"红柚酸奶碗","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666290/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红柚","amount":"2瓣"},{"name":"无糖酸奶","amount":"200ml（或希腊酸奶）"}],"sub":[{"name":"核桃","amount":"2个"},{"name":"杂粮麦片","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胖子三红蜂蜜柚。","img":"images/666290/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"首先把柚子两头的屁股切掉，把柚子外面的薄膜和柚子皮，紧地按在一起，把果肉剥出来。","img":"images/666290/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"掰小块。","img":"images/666290/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"食材备用。","img":"images/666290/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"碗底铺上酸奶。","img":"images/666290/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再铺上红柚肉。","img":"images/666290/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"继续铺上杂粮麦片。","img":"images/666290/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后铺上核桃。","img":"images/666290/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀，即可享用。","img":"images/666290/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"酸甜可口。","img":"images/666290/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}